= Senator Mon Mothma of Chandrila

Young, eloquent and principled, Chandrila’s senator believes the Republic’s strength lies in its laws, not its armies.

[? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : *Our advisors can act again in [+ advisor_action_timer +] turn(s).* ?]

- @mothma_speech: Speak for the Republic.
- @mothma_peace: Rally the peace wing.
- @mothma_vigilance: Warn of overreach.
- @go_back: Back.

@mothma_speech
subtitle: +2 faith in the Republic and more support in the Core and Colonies.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: Our advisors have already acted recently.
on-arrival: faith += 2; core_rc += 1; colonies_rc += 1; advisor_action_timer = 5

Mon Mothma’s speech on the meaning of the Ruusan settlement is replayed across the HoloNet for days.

@mothma_peace
subtitle: Calms the Pacifists; cools separatism in the Mid Rim.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: Our advisors have already acted recently.
on-arrival: pacifist_dissent -= 8; midrim_sep -= 2; advisor_action_timer = 5

Mothma reminds the Caucus why it exists: to keep the peace by keeping faith with every member world.

@mothma_vigilance
subtitle: +0.5 Senate resolve (only credible once there are emergency powers or some evidence).
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: Our advisors have already acted recently.
on-arrival: senate_resolve += 0.5 if emergency_powers > 0 or evidence >= 2; faith += 0.5; advisor_action_timer = 5

“Every surrender of our authority,” Mothma tells the Senate, “is made in the name of a crisis. And every crisis ends, except the surrender.”
